# CLEAN FULL-GMLC PSAP ABNORMAL ROUTING REPORT v2
# =====================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
# GMLC.NENA_ID IS NOT USED.
#
# ROUTED PSAP is resolved from:
#
#   GMLC.PSAP_ID
#       vs
#   Boundary.PSAP_ID
#   Boundary.NENA_ID (canonical zero-padding comparison)
#
# AND cross-checked with:
#
#   GMLC.FCC_PSAP_ID
#       vs
#   Boundary.FCC_PSAP_ID / FCC_ID
#
#
# NAMES DO NOT SELECT THE BOUNDARY.
#
# Names are attached afterward for QA:
#
#   Boundary.PSAP_NAME
#   Boundary.PSAP_NAME_ESRK
#   Boundary.AGENCY
#
#
# EXPECTED PSAP:
#
#   Caller coordinate
#       -> GeoPandas spatial join
#       -> expected NENA_ID
#       -> expected PSAP_ID
#       -> expected FCC_PSAP_ID
#       -> expected names from multiple boundary sources
#
# Same for CELL.
#
#
# CLEAN OUTPUT:
#
#   CALL
#   ROUTED IDs + names
#
#   CALLER:
#       lat/lon
#       inside/outside routed
#       distance to routed boundary
#       expected IDs
#       expected names + name sources
#       expected vs routed ID/name status
#
#   CELL:
#       same
#
#   CALLER <-> CELL distance
#
#
# DISTANCES ARE METERS.
#
# =====================================================================

